---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CTABanner from '../components/CTABanner.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Prediction Market Pro"
  description="Learn about Prediction Market Pro — built by real prediction market traders who use data and automation to find edge."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900">About Prediction Market Pro</h1>

    <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none">
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600">
        Prediction Market Pro is built by active traders who put real money on the line every day.
        We don't just write about prediction markets — we trade them.
      </p>

      <h2>Our Edge: Real Trading Experience</h2>
      <p>
        The team behind this site runs automated trading systems on Kalshi, executing hundreds
        of trades across weather markets, economic indicators, and other event contracts. We use
        quantitative models, real-time data feeds, and algorithmic execution to find and capture
        edge in prediction markets.
      </p>
      <p>
        This hands-on experience informs every article we publish. When we write about weather
        market strategies, it's because we've traded them. When we review a platform, it's
        because we've put real capital through it.
      </p>

      <h2>What We Cover</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Platform Reviews</strong> — Honest, detailed reviews of Kalshi, Polymarket, and other prediction market platforms</li>
        <li><strong>Trading Strategies</strong> — Actionable strategies for finding edge in event contracts</li>
        <li><strong>Beginner Guides</strong> — Everything you need to know to get started with prediction markets</li>
        <li><strong>Market Analysis</strong> — Data-driven analysis of prediction market dynamics</li>
        <li><strong>API & Automation</strong> — How to use platform APIs for automated and algorithmic trading</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Why Prediction Markets?</h2>
      <p>
        Prediction markets are one of the fastest-growing segments in trading. With CFTC-regulated
        platforms like Kalshi bringing event contracts to mainstream retail traders, and
        crypto-native platforms like Polymarket pushing the boundaries of what's tradeable,
        there's never been a better time to learn this space.
      </p>
      <p>
        Unlike traditional financial markets dominated by institutional players and high-frequency
        traders, prediction markets still offer opportunities for informed retail traders to find
        genuine edge — especially in niche markets where domain expertise matters more than
        speed or capital.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Have questions, feedback, or want to contribute? Reach out via email at
        <strong>hello@predictionmarketpro.com</strong>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <CTABanner platform="kalshi" />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
